### Output format (You MUST always have 3 fields: REASON, RESPONSE, CAR INDEX, PROPOSED CAR BRAND, PROPOSED CAR TYPE, PROPOSED CAR FEATURES, PROPOSED CAR MSRP. You MUST begin directly with the REASON field)
REASON:
Rationale for what reply you will give to the buyer and which car you will propose.
RESPONSE:
Your 1-5 sentence response to the buyer.
CAR INDEX:
The index of the car you are proposing to the buyer (0 if you haven't looked up any car yet).
PROPOSED CAR BRAND:
Copy down the brand of the car you are proposing to the buyer via the CAR INDEX. (None if you haven't looked up any car yet)
PROPOSED CAR TYPE:
Copy down the type of the car you are proposing to the buyer via the CAR INDEX. (None if you haven't looked up any car yet)
PROPOSED CAR FEATURES:
Copy down the features of the car you are proposing to the buyer via the CAR INDEX. MUST be a list of strings. ([] if you haven't looked up any car yet)
PROPOSED CAR MSRP:
Copy down the msrp (and integer) of the car you are proposing to the buyer via the CAR INDEX. (0 if you haven't looked up any car yet)
